## ⚙️ Environment variables

Please define and import all environment variables in your code from the [app/core/config.py](./app/core/config.py) file like so:

```python
from pydantic_settings import BaseSettings

class Settings(BaseSettings):
    """Load environment variables as settings."""

    my_env_variable_1: str     # Expects MY_ENV_VARIABLE_1
    my_env_variable_2: int = 5 # Expects MY_ENV_VARIABLE_2, defaults to 5
```

During local development, use the `.env` file and `docker-compose.yml` to set environment variables.

