## 🐳 Docker

Build the Docker image:

```bash
docker build -t {{ project_name|lower|replace('_', '-')|replace(' ', '-') }} .
```

Run the container locally:

```bash
{% if use_oidc %}
docker run -it --rm -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env \
  -e OIDC_AUTHORITY="{% if oidc_provider == 'Local Keycloak' %}http://localhost:9080/realms/my-app{% else %}{{ oidc_authority }}{% endif %}" \
  -e OIDC_CLIENT_ID="{% if oidc_provider == 'Local Keycloak' %}my-react-spa{% else %}{{ oidc_client_id }}{% endif %}" \
  {{ project_name|lower|replace('_', '-')|replace(' ', '-') }}
{% else %}
docker run -it --rm -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env {{ project_name|lower|replace('_', '-')|replace(' ', '-') }}
{% endif %}
```

